{
  "id": "queue-loop-day-end-learning",
  "title": "A learning card due at day_ends_at does not hold the day open (goal_reached); one due 1 ms before it does (waiting) (ADR-049)",
  "covers": [
    "queue.loop_learning_past_day_end"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "scheduler.reviews_unlimited is true, new_per_day is 1, default time zone: the study day 2026-11-20 ends at 2026-11-21T04:00:00.000Z. Cards ...10, ...20 and ...30 are new; nothing is due. The first learning step is 60 s.",
    "Step 0, 03:59:00.000: ...10 is answered Again (reviewed_at given explicitly): learning, due_at 04:00:00.000 = day_ends_at exactly.",
    "Step 1, 03:59:01: the goal is reached (1/1), nothing is ready and the only learning card falls due at day_ends_at, which is not 'later today' (later today is now < due_at < day_ends_at): later_today.count 0, until_stop 0, phase goal_reached (keep_going_available true: new cards remain). The loop does not wait for a card of the next study day. The deprecated counts.learning is 0 and next_learning_due_at is absent.",
    "Step 2, 03:59:02: ...20 is answered Again with reviewed_at 03:58:59.999 (a late submission; answers are not gated by the goal): due_at 03:59:59.999, 1 ms before day_ends_at.",
    "Step 3, 03:59:03: that card is later today: waiting, later_today.count 1, next_due_at 03:59:59.999, until_stop 0 (parts 0/1/0/0: later is not in the total, ADR-054), keep_going_available true; new.today 2 exceeds the goal 1. ...10 is still not counted.",
    "Step 4, 03:59:59.999: ...20 is ready and served (reviewing, 1 learning); ...10 is neither ready nor later today.",
    "Step 5, 04:00:01, study day 2026-11-21: both learning cards are ready learning of the new day, in (due_at, card id) order ...20 then ...10, followed by the new card ...30 (goal 1, 0 introduced): until_stop 3 = 2 learning + 0 later + 0 reviews + 1 new."
  ],
